(text "MCU STM32U585 + LIAISON DJI PSDK" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2debbb06-090f-47d1-a157-3e9ea208ba10"))
(text "STM32U585CIU6 : Cortex-M33 160 MHz, 2 Mo flash, 786 Ko RAM, 19 uA/MHz, TrustZone + AES/PKA materiels." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "048d4e4e-6f77-488f-8647-c809f82b7050"))
(text "PSDK : DJI fournit la lib precompilee armcc_cortex-m33 -> compilation Keil MDK (Arm Compiler 6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7842a580-84fb-473e-af08-a6e03aec1b64"))
(text "USART1 (PA9/PA10) 921600 bauds vers le kit E-Port V2 ; R14/R15 = protection du cable." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "90ca433d-439e-432a-92c6-e2f68c2db534"))
(text "Horloge : MSI calibre en PLL sur LSE 32,768 kHz (+/-0,25 %) -> pas de quartz HSE ; quartz CL 7 pF, C = 10 pF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 39 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3b05f874-792f-4bcf-adda-efdc63a6d297"))
(text "ADC1 : PA0 VIN, PA1 I_HOLD, PA2 I_LED, PA3 I_EJECT. PWM : TIM1_CH1 maintien, TIM2_CH1 ejection, TIM15_CH1 LED. PB12 ARM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05219a85-272f-4721-b3d6-fcd25c730335"))
